#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
msgid "Simple Tile"
msgstr "简单平铺"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid ""
"A plugin which provides some tiling features, inspired by Sway. The plugin "
"is meant to contain only the basics."
msgstr "提供一些平铺功能、受 Sway 启发的插件。该插件只包含基础功能。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Tile enabled for specified window types"
msgstr "为指定窗口类型启用平铺"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Enables tiling for windows matching the specified criteria."
msgstr "为匹配指定条件的窗口启用平铺。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Keep fullscreen on adjacent"
msgstr "切换到相邻窗口时保持全屏"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Specifies whether to keep fullscreen state when changing the focus. If "
"**true**, the next focused window will also get fullscreen. If **false**, "
"leaves fullscreen."
msgstr "指定切换焦点时是否保持全屏状态。若为 **true**，下一个聚焦的窗口也会进入全屏；若为 **false**，则退出全屏。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Button move"
msgstr "拖动按钮"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"When the specified button is held down, you can drag and drop tiled windows "
"to reorder them and to change the tiling direction."
msgstr "按住指定按钮时，可以拖放平铺窗口以重新排序并更改平铺方向。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Button resize"
msgstr "调整大小按钮"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"When the specified button is held down, you can drag tiled windows to resize "
"them."
msgstr "按住指定按钮时，可以拖动平铺窗口来调整其大小。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Key toggle"
msgstr "切换按键"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Toggles tiling mode with the specified key."
msgstr "使用指定按键切换平铺模式。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Key focus left"
msgstr "向左聚焦按键"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Moves focus to the window left with the specified key."
msgstr "使用指定按键将焦点移到左侧窗口。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Key focus right"
msgstr "向右聚焦按键"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Moves focus to the window right with the specified key."
msgstr "使用指定按键将焦点移到右侧窗口。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Key focus above"
msgstr "向上聚焦按键"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Moves focus to the window above with the specified key."
msgstr "使用指定按键将焦点移到上方窗口。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Key focus below"
msgstr "向下聚焦按键"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Moves focus to the window below with the specified key."
msgstr "使用指定按键将焦点移到下方窗口。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Key toggle maximized"
msgstr "切换最大化按键"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Toggles the maximized state of the currently focused tiled view. When "
"enabled, the view fills the workarea (like fullscreen, but stays in its "
"tile). When disabled, the view returns to its previous tiled size."
msgstr "切换当前聚焦平铺窗口的最大化状态。启用时，窗口填满工作区（类似全屏，但仍保留在平铺位置）；禁用时，窗口恢复为之前的平铺大小。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Inner gap size"
msgstr "内部间隙大小"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Number of pixels to shrink of a view when it has a neighbor in a given "
"direction."
msgstr "窗口在某个方向上有相邻窗口时缩小的像素数。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Outer horizontal gap size"
msgstr "外部水平间隙大小"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Number of pixels to shrink of a view when it has no neighbor on the left or "
"on the right."
msgstr "窗口左/右没有相邻窗口时缩小的像素数。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Outer vertical gap size"
msgstr "外部垂直间隙大小"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Number of pixels to shrink of a view when it has no neighbor above or below."
msgstr "窗口上/下没有相邻窗口时缩小的像素数。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Resize animation duration"
msgstr "调整大小动画持续时间"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"The duration of the crossfade animation in situations where a tiled view's "
"geometry changes."
msgstr "平铺窗口几何尺寸变化时交叉淡化动画的持续时间。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Preview fill color"
msgstr "预览填充颜色"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Preview border color"
msgstr "预览边框颜色"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Preview border width"
msgstr "预览边框宽度"
